<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's premier plans 48-hour visit to Italy.</title>
<headline>Morocco's premier plans 48-hour visit to Italy.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Premier Abdellatif Filali begins a 48-hour official visit to Italy on Wednesday, the official MAP news agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>Filali will be accompanied by an important ministerial and businessmen delegation, the agency added.</p>
